```mermaid
%% 告警生命周期数据流图
sequenceDiagram
    participant Sensor as 跌倒传感器
    participant TB as ThingsBoard
    participant RC as Rule Chain
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Widget as 告警卡片
    participant User as 值班护士
    participant Emergency as 急救服务
    
    %% T+0s: 检测阶段
    rect rgb(255, 235, 238)
    Note over Sensor,Emergency: T+0s - 检测阶段 (DETECTED)
    Sensor->>TB: MQTT 遥测数据<br/>{fallDetected: true, location: "客厅"}
    TB->>RC: 触发 Rule Chain
    RC->>RC: 创建告警 (Create Alarm)
    RC->>DB: INSERT alarm_timelines<br/>events: [{stage: "DETECTED"}]
    RC->>Widget: 推送告警通知
    Widget->>Widget: 显示告警卡片 (红色)
    end
    
    %% T+15s: 响应阶段
    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note over Sensor,Emergency: T+15s - 响应阶段 (RESPONDED)
    User->>Widget: 点击"确认告警"
    Widget->>RC: RPC: acknowledgeAlarm()
    RC->>DB: UPDATE events<br/>添加 {stage: "RESPONDED"}
    RC->>Widget: 返回确认结果
    Widget->>Widget: 更新状态为"已确认"
    end
    
    %% T+30s: 处理阶段 - 呼叫急救
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over Sensor,Emergency: T+30s - 处理阶段 (HANDLING)
    User->>Widget: 点击"呼叫急救"
    Widget->>RC: RPC: callEmergency()
    RC->>Emergency: 调用 120 API
    Emergency-->>RC: 返回 callId, ETA
    RC->>DB: UPDATE events<br/>添加 {stage: "HANDLING", event: "emergency_called"}
    RC->>Widget: 返回呼叫结果
    Widget->>Widget: 显示"急救已调度"
    end
    
    %% T+15min: 急救到达
    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
    Note over Sensor,Emergency: T+15min - 急救到达
    Emergency->>RC:  webhook: 急救到达
    RC->>DB: UPDATE events<br/>添加 {event: "emergency_arrived"}
    RC->>Widget: 推送状态更新
    end
    
    %% T+20min: 解决阶段
    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
    Note over Sensor,Emergency: T+20min - 解决阶段 (RESOLVED)
    User->>Widget: 点击"标记误报"
    Widget->>RC: RPC: markAsFalseAlarm()
    RC->>TB: Clear Alarm
    RC->>DB: UPDATE<br/>• events: 添加 {stage: "RESOLVED"}<br/>• outcome: {status: "FALSE_ALARM"}<br/>• resolved_at: NOW()
    RC->>Widget: 返回结果
    Widget->>Widget: 卡片变绿 (已解决)
    end
```
